OL,3,GNEWSACould understanding trauma help
OL,4,Aprevent knife attacks?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the first time in England and
OL,7,FWales, a police force is working with
OL,8,Fan educational psychologist to help
OL,9,Fstop young people becoming involved in
OL,10,Fknife crime.
OL,12,FThe year-long partnership between
OL,13,FWiltshire Police and psychologist Dr
OL,14,FBrooke Hamblin will train officers to
OL,15,Fbetter understand vulnerable children
OL,16,Fand provide specialist support to those
OL,17,Fat risk of offending.
OL,19,FThe Home Office-funded pilot comes as
OL,20,Fknife crime in Wiltshire rose by 6% in
OL,21,Fthe year to May 2026, bucking the
OL,22,Fnational trend of falling offences.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
