OL,3,GNEWSACould understanding trauma help
OL,4,Aprevent knife attacks?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJo Davis, whose family friend Owen Dunn
OL,7,Fwas stabbed to death in 2022, said: "I
OL,8,Ffirmly believe if this was in place
OL,9,Fbefore, Owen would still be here."
